=== base ===
# IT Support Agreement

This Agreement is made between Corbel Systems Ltd (the "Supplier") and Lintwhite Solicitors LLP (the "Client").

## 6. Backups
6.1 The Supplier shall back up the Client's file server every night.
6.2 The Supplier shall test a restore once each quarter.
=== amendment ===
# Amendment No. 3

This Amendment is made on 3 March 2028 between Corbel Systems Ltd (the "Supplier") and Lintwhite Solicitors LLP (the "Client").

## 1. Changes
1.1 Clause 6.2 is deleted and replaced with the following:

6.2 The Supplier shall test a restore once each month and report the result to the Client.

1.2 Save as amended, the Agreement continues in full force.
